<title>USA: Advocat Inc Q4 net rises.</title>
<headline>Advocat Inc Q4 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKLIN, Tenn. 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>For the Three Months     For the Year</p>
<p>			 Ended December 31,   Ended December 31,</p>
<p>			1996	  1995	   1996	   1995</p>
<p> Net revenues   44,282,000  37,292,000  166,237,000  139,965,000</p>
<p> Total expenses 41,940,000  36,015,000  158,861,000  133,075,000</p>
<p> Net Income	1,499,000     817,000    4,721,000    4,410,000</p>
<p> Earnings per Share   0.28	  0.15	   0.89	   0.83</p>
<p>Common shares</p>
<p>  outstanding    5,323,000   5,340,000    5,315,000    5,333,000</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
</text>
